{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic PBC這場超大型IPO的市場氛圍略有回暖：Meta宣佈規模達950億美元的股票發售，科技股也從10月低點小幅回升。但仍存在一些不利因素：IPO市場整體環境承壓，Anthropic的融資目標極其宏大，而本次IPO成敗將對股市與信貸市場產生重大影響。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584456.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:44:50.032315+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:18:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:38:52.652874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:38:52.652874+00:00","content_hash":"a969ccdfc0e268a799a094f8d74f527e768721cfc5da8b95e4084b7a1d8b3616","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}